# What never goes into an image.
#
# Written BEFORE the Dockerfiles, and deliberately so. The build context for
# every image in docker/ is the repository root, so anything not excluded here
# is uploaded to the daemon and is a candidate for a stray `COPY . .` to pick
# up. An image that quietly ships the test suite, the planning notes and the
# marking journal is the failure this file exists to prevent - the images are
# a deliverable the client may run, and the client is not the audience for
# .superpowers/ or Journal/.
#
# The Dockerfiles name their sources explicitly rather than copying the whole
# context, so this file is the second line of defence, not the only one. Both
# are kept: a `COPY . .` added in a hurry six months from now is exactly the
# change nobody will review for this.

# --- Version control and tooling metadata ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.codex/
.superpowers/
.claude/

# --- Tests. Not shipped: the wheel is the deliverable, the suite is not. ---
tests/
pytest.ini
.pytest_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
.coverage.*

# --- Documentation and course material ---
docs/
Journal/
README.md
CLAUDE.md
project.md
*.pptx
*.docx
*.pdf

# --- Python build and cache output ---
# `**/` is load-bearing: a bare `__pycache__/` matches only the context root,
# because Docker matches these patterns against the whole relative path rather
# than against each path component. Without it every package directory would
# ship its own bytecode - compiled by whichever Python the developer happens to
# run (3.12 here) into an image whose interpreter is 3.11.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
venv/
.venv/
env/

# --- Secrets and local configuration ---
# .env is git-ignored and machine-local. A container gets its configuration
# from the environment (docker/compose.yaml), never from a baked-in file, and
# an image carrying a developer's SECRET_KEY would hand every later deployment
# the same one.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Local development state ---
docker-compose.yml
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- iCloud / editor debris ---
*.icloud
* 2.*
*~
